<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>If you're hunting for a pipe fence builder in Waco TX, you want a crew that's worked cattle, not just set posts. Brazos Ridge Fence Co. builds welded 2-3/8 inch drill-stem pipe fence for ranches across McLennan, Bosque, and Falls counties, and we build it to take a hit from a 1,400 pound bull and stay standing. Most pipe fence around here runs $12 to $28 per linear foot depending on rail count, gates, and how rocky your ground is.</p><p>We also hang cattle-tight net wire at $3.50 to $8 per foot, and we build corrals and working pens that move cattle the way cattle actually move. If you're still comparing options, our <a href="/ranch-fence-cost/">ranch fence cost guide</a> lays out real numbers side by side, and <a href="/barbed-wire-fence-waco/">barbed wire</a> is there when the budget calls for it. Call (254) 555-0184 and we'll walk your fence line with you.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Handle</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">What's Included in Every Visit</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 8px;">Welded 2-3/8 Inch Drill-Stem Pipe</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Heavy-wall oilfield drill stem, welded at every joint instead of clamped. It doesn't sag, lean, or pop loose when livestock lean on it.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 8px;">Cattle-Tight Net Wire</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Net wire runs $3.50 to $8 per foot and pairs well with a pipe top rail. It holds calves, goats, and sheep that walk right through barbed wire.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 8px;">Corrals and Working Pens</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Pens, alleys, and crowding areas laid out so cattle flow instead of fight you. Built heavy where the pressure is.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 8px;">Outlasts Wood by Decades</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">A welded pipe fence goes 40 to 50 years with almost no upkeep. Wood posts in Central Texas clay start rotting out in 15 to 20.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 8px;">Gates and Entrances That Match</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Pipe swing gates, cattle guards, and custom entrance work built from the same drill stem as your fence. One look, one welder, no mismatch.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #e3ded4;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 8px;">Free Written Estimates</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Licensed and insured, with real per-foot numbers in writing before we start. We also run a 24/7 line for storm damage and cattle-out emergencies.</p>
      </div>
</div>
